IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-RADIX-ATTENTION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOKEN-COUNT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MATCHED-PREFIX      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HIT-RATIO-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-RADIX-ATTN.
    IF TOKEN-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE MATCHED-PREFIX = TOKEN-COUNT / 2.
    IF MATCHED-PREFIX == 0
        MOVE 1 TO MATCHED-PREFIX.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE HIT-RATIO-PCT = (MATCHED-PREFIX * 100) / TOKEN-COUNT.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 HIT-RATIO-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 MATCHED-PREFIX.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
